# Fail / File: .env.example
# Pembangun / Developer: Zrain
# Dicipta / Created: 2026-10-26 (bukti: sejarah Git zrain-auth-starter)
# Dikemas kini / Last updated: 2026-11-04
# BM: Senaraikan pemboleh ubah yang perlu diisi secara setempat; jangan simpan secret sebenar dalam Git.
# EN: List locally supplied environment variables; never store real secrets in Git.
# Copy these names into your operating-system environment.
# Do not commit real JWT signing keys. Generate a new 32-byte random key.
SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local
ZRAIN_JWT_SECRET_BASE64=REPLACE_WITH_RANDOM_BASE64_KEY
ZRAIN_JWT_ISSUER=zrain-auth-starter
ZRAIN_JWT_AUDIENCE=zrain-auth-starter-api
ZRAIN_JWT_ACCESS_MINUTES=15
